    },
    {
      "id": "hv-1",
      "conflict": "The primary intent behind current AI development.",
      "prevails": "undecidable",
      "criterion": "empirical_evidence",
      "rationale": "Both sides offer competing interpretations of market behavior without providing verifiable data on the intent of AI developers. Whether AI development serves as a neutral tool for post-scarcity or a tool for wealth concentration depends on longitudinal economic data that does not yet exist.",
      "whatWouldChange": "A comprehensive study of capital distribution and labor displacement trends following the deployment of autonomous systems in critical infrastructure over a five-year period.",
